Description: GXDE poortal backend for xdg-desktop-portal
  xdg-desktop-portal-gxde provide a GXDE implementation for the
  desktop-agnostic xdg-desktop-portal service. This allows sandboxed
  applications to request services from outside the sandbox using
  GXDE GUIs (app chooser, file chooser, print dialog) or using GNOME
  services (session manager, screenshot provider).
